Dear Alex,

Commercial terms for your proposal:

- Fixed price. Board-approved budget EUR 2.3 million for implementation and migration.
- Go-live for all three lines of business (motor, travel and home) by 1 July 2027. We
  cannot run two claims systems through another storm season.
- Volumes for sizing: 30,000 claims a month, with storm peaks of 3x.
- Every claim decision, including automatic settlements, must be approved by a claim
  handler before payment. Our compliance team will not accept unattended payments.
- Availability 99.9% during business hours (08:00-20:00, Monday to Saturday); FNOL
  online 24/7.
- Payment schedule: 25% at design sign-off, 25% at trial migration, 35% at go-live, 15%
  after the first storm season.
- Retention of 10% of each payment until all priority 1 and 2 defects are closed.
- Show allowances for unknowns separately, with hours. Our audit committee reviews them.

Kind regards,
Declan Moran
Procurement Manager
